# Languages + countries floor (Ghal Bol)

Every Ghal Bol **app and website** supports the full language catalogue
(**115+ languages**) and **199 countries**.

## Do

- Full catalogue picker; packs under `/i18n/<code>.tsv` for the site.
- `lang-nav.js` + `site-i18n.js` + `data-i18n` on marketing home and account
  (static site — no wasm walker).
- Script fonts so non-Latin packs actually paint.
- Local language proof before Hosting deploy.

## Do not

- Cosmetic lang-nav with no `site-i18n` / packs.
- Subset pickers or English-only marketing while showing a language chip.
